[----------] Global test environment tear-down
[==========] 2 tests from 1 test suite ran. (0 ms total)
[  PASSED  ] 2 tests.

The test asserts, while the task is activated-but-blocked:
  EXPECT_EQ(sched.Pick(), nullptr)        // picker rejects it
  EXPECT_EQ(sched.Step(), -1)             // scheduler does not fire it
  EXPECT_EQ(FireCount(), 0u)              // NO premature fire
and only after @unblock:
  EXPECT_EQ(sched.Step(), id)             // fires once released
A PASS therefore proves the blocked task did not fire prematurely.

